    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mouse is your LIFE \u2013 swing it without shame!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Forward</i>, a 3D side-scrolling hell where &quot;physics engine&quot; becomes &quot;physics torture&quot;! Ditch the keyboard; your mouse is the only savior (or killer). <strong>DRAG and WHIP</strong> that floppy (or rigid?) hero body with the cursor through brutal 3D stages \u2013 squirm, climb, launch, wrestle! One tiny mistake may send you spiraling to heaven, free-falling, or stuck in absurd corners questioning life. Excruciatingly brutal with bizarre deaths, yet your clumsy struggles might trigger explosive laughter or philosophical silence... <strong>Reach the end BY ANY MEANS! ROLL, MOUSE HERO!</strong> The ecstasy of victory will redeem all &quot;agony&quot;.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mouse is your LIFE \u2013 swing it without shame!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Forward</i>, a 3D side-scrolling hell where &quot;physics engine&quot; becomes &quot;physics torture&quot;! Ditch the keyboard; your mouse is the only savior (or killer). <strong>DRAG and WHIP</strong> that floppy (or rigid?) hero body with the cursor through brutal 3D stages \u2013 squirm, climb, launch, wrestle! One tiny mistake may send you spiraling to heaven, free-falling, or stuck in absurd corners questioning life. Excruciatingly brutal with bizarre deaths, yet your clumsy struggles might trigger explosive laughter or philosophical silence... <strong>Reach the end BY ANY MEANS! ROLL, MOUSE HERO!</strong> The ecstasy of victory will redeem all &quot;agony&quot;.</p>",
